exports[`done-for-you messages (golden) > forwarding text + email 1`] = `
"Hi Jane,

We've set up Jane's Roofing. One thing only you can do: turn on call forwarding on your business phone, so every call you miss gets a text back in seconds.

Open this on your business phone: https://app.crankleads.test/forward/AbCdEfGhIjKlMnOpQrStUvWxYz012345

Your phone still rings first — only the calls you miss or can't take are forwarded. We test it automatically and text you when it works.

Rather have us do it? Open the link and tap "Have us set it up" — we'll call you.

— The CrankLeads team"
`;

